; Whole-surface regression pin for the stops public API (issue #2503).
;
; stops_surface_trace.exe prints one line per call over a deterministic sweep
; of every `val` in weinstein_stops.mli, with floats in %.17g. The golden
; (stops_surface_trace.expected) was generated at 3782920a — the parent of
; PR #2492's squash merge 4141beda — so the diff below is simultaneously:
;
;   (a) the proof that #2492's Stop_geometry extraction left the DEFAULT path
;       bit-identical (the golden is the pre-#2492 output and HEAD reproduces
;       it byte-for-byte), and
;   (b) a standing pin, so the next stops refactor cannot silently reassociate
;       a multiply / round / Float.min chain and shift a stop by one ULP.
;
; Regenerate deliberately, never reflexively: `dune promote` after a diff means
; "I intend to change live stop behaviour", which needs a golden re-pin and an
; experiment-ledger entry, not a promote.

(executable
 (name stops_surface_trace)
 (libraries core weinstein_trading.stops weinstein.types types trading.base))

(rule
 (with-stdout-to
  stops_surface_trace.actual
  (run %{exe:stops_surface_trace.exe})))

(rule
 (alias runtest)
 (action
  (diff stops_surface_trace.expected stops_surface_trace.actual)))
